{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124085019966-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124085601\"/><p>事主被送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。</p><p>馬鞍山有人暈倒。今日(24日)清晨6時56分，一名男子報案，指其姓龔(44歲)妻子在寧泰路33號一單位內暈倒。救護車接報到場將昏迷事主送往威爾斯親王醫院治理，女子暈倒原因有待了解。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:03:28.352188+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T00:50:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:37:22.583614+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T00:57:01.335421+00:00","content_hash":"1cbc5cfe7302740d371bbd393f99ebae983df76e5c8c4813cbf3b8023aee92fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}